{"v":4,"catch":"超過12,000個單位在戰場上戰鬥！","desc":"<故事>\n敵人是摧毀了他的家族和帝國的人類軍隊。\n\n成為惡魔混血兒阿爾維亞公主，引導他們的靈魂。\n\n<遊戲系統>\n* 收集惡魔，訓練軍隊，大軍對大軍作戰！\n\n* 與你訓練有素的軍隊與你的朋友和來自世界各地的人們競爭！\n\n* 在Nintendo Switch™版本中，您還可以與家人和朋友合作玩！\n\n<進化的原創遊戲引擎>\n自從上一款遊戲《Vaster Claws 3》以來的三年裡，我們改進了專用遊戲引擎，並編寫了專門針對部落對部落的程式。\n大量單位發生碰撞，這在 Nintendo Switch™ 上被認為是不可能的。","publisher":"Mediascape","release":"2024-02-01","genres":["模擬","策略","動作"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.2GB / Switch 0.2GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/47e9d99ecaaa7c79c779d6c1d169cc72feccfd2b9f679604b0fe20f3ea4afdc2.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a5d2cec64ca9148c157bc1ca12ec2d54a22147d0f24bd92f7adce62c96a5faa4.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/893b90a3b38c539a41c15cadadca86c6145d51c89b286ef6d4ebc40908e221a8.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/fcdc933cca5c2260ec11e5a8c95337ecd4ce06b50556268921ecc017eabff38b.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/9d647f6c02b76833138238d490c5d90a58ca1a1f793edcf4bf34ab40e9edc495.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/909d973ed1bfcb530cf522da653478ec00cffdc6b396693786b5c2c87171ca0f.jpg"],"titleId":"01003e001db78000","dlc":[]}